    "title": "GATEWAY-apiwizdoc-List Weather Alerts Status-v5-spec",
    "description": "The Weather Alerts Status API provides users with the latest information regarding weather alerts and their respective statuses. This endpoint allows consumers to access critical data points related to weather warnings, advisories, and watches issued by meteorological services. Typical use cases include integration into applications that track severe weather conditions for safety notifications, as well as for developers building solutions in the travel, logistics, and emergency management sectors. It serves as a vital resource for developers seeking to enhance user awareness about changing weather conditions.",
